OL,3,GNEWSANinety-year-old calls for
OL,4,A'acceptable ID' clarity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nonagenarian who no longer owns a
OL,7,Fpassport or a driving licence is
OL,8,Fcalling for greater clarity about what
OL,9,Fconstitutes legal identification.
OL,11,FShirley Dorsett, from Aylesbury in
OL,12,FBuckinghamshire, was told her bus pass
OL,13,Fwas not acceptable as ID to renew her
OL,14,Fposition as director of the building
OL,15,Fwhere she lives.
OL,17,FProperty management company Foster Kemp
OL,18,Fsaid that "identity checks matter" in
OL,19,Forder to comply with Companies House
OL,20,Frequirements.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
